.TH FL-POLKIT-AGENT 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-polkit-agent \- polkit authentication agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-polkit-agent\fR [\fB\-\-process\fR \fIPID\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the password dialog when a program asks polkit for an administrative
action (for example \fBpkexec\fR, \fBtimedatectl\fR or NetworkManager system
connections). The dialog names the action, lets you pick the administrator
when there is more than one, and shows the action id and details on request.
.PP
The agent is started at login through
\fI/etc/xdg/autostart/fl-polkit-agent.desktop\fR (fldesktop sessions only)
and registers for the whole login session.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-process\fR \fIPID\fR
Register only for the process \fIPID\fR instead of the session (for tests,
or for use beside another agent).
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpolkit\fR(8), \fBpkexec\fR(1), \fBfl-autostart\fR(1)
